              Link to related concepts instead of duplicating them. Use relative
              Markdown links for nearby files

              and `/`-prefixed bundle paths for links from the repository root;
              include the `.md` extension. Keep

              code in fenced blocks with a language. Reference images with
              useful alt text and relative paths.


              ## Charts


              When numbers are easier to understand as a chart, in a concept or
              in a reply, write a fenced code

              block whose language is `vega-lite` and whose content is a
              Vega-Lite spec as strict JSON: double

              quotes, no comments or trailing commas. The app draws the chart in
              place of the block, and other

